  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to become bright and lively; to become gorgeous; to become festive",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to become bright and lively; to become gorgeous; to become festive",
      "explanation": "An intransitive verb describing a scene, atmosphere, or appearance becoming vibrant and glamorous."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "27114_hanayagu_ex1",
      "japanese": "{会場|かいじょう}が{華|はな}やいだ。",
      "english": "The venue became lively and festive.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27114_hanayagu_ex2",
      "japanese": "{春|はる}になると{街|まち}が{華|はな}やぐ。",
      "english": "The town brightens up when spring comes.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27114_hanayagu_ex3",
      "japanese": "{彼女|かのじょ}がいるだけで{場|ば}の{雰囲気|ふんいき}が{華|はな}やぐ。",
      "english": "Just having her there makes the atmosphere brighter and more glamorous.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27114_hanayagu_ex4",
      "japanese": "{花|はな}を{飾|かざ}ると{部屋|へや}が{華|はな}やいだ{感|かん}じになる。",
      "english": "Decorating with flowers gives the room a brighter, more elegant feel.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "An intransitive godan verb meaning to become bright, glamorous, or festive. Often used to describe how a place, event, or atmosphere gains vibrancy and elegance. The past participle {華|はな}やいだ is frequently used as a modifier meaning \"vibrant\" or \"gorgeous.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {場|ば}が{華|はな}やぐ: the atmosphere brightens up\n- {華|はな}やいだ{雰囲気|ふんいき}: a vibrant atmosphere\n- {華|はな}やいだ{笑顔|えがお}: a radiant smile\n- {華|はな}やいだ{気分|きぶん}: a festive mood\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {華|はな}やか: gorgeous, glamorous — the adjective form describing the same quality\n- {賑|にぎ}わう: to be lively/bustling — emphasizes crowds and activity rather than elegance",
